{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 2, "model_name": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "content": "Fair traveler thou seekest to journey to Japan's fair shore\nThy sojourn shall commence in Tokyo's vibrant streets\nOn day one thou shalt arrive in this most wondrous city\nAnd take thy rest in a humble inn or hotel of some renown\n\nOn second day thou shalt rise with morning's golden light\nAnd visit the famous Tsukiji Fish Market's bustling throngs\nWhere thou shalt sample the freshest sushi to delight thy taste\nAnd marvel at the skill of vendors who with deft hands do prepare\n\nThird day shall bring thee to the majestic Tokyo Tower's height\nFrom whence thou shalt behold the city's sprawling majesty\nAnd in the evening thou shalt stroll through the gardens of the Imperial Palace\nWhere ancient traditions and modernity do entwine in harmony\n\nFourth day shall be devoted to the sacred shrines and temples of old\nWhere thou shalt pay homage to the gods and learn of Japan's storied past\nIn the afternoon thou shalt visit the Meiji Shrine's serene and peaceful grounds\nWhere the whispers of the forest and the wind do soothe thy soul\n\nFifth day shall bring thee to the city of Kyoto's gentle charm\nWhere thou shalt wander through the Philosopher's Path's winding course\nAnd visit the famous Fushimi Inari Shrine's thousand vermilion gates\nWhere thou shalt behold the majesty of Japan's ancient faith\n\nSixth day shall be spent in the company of the geishas of Gion's quarter\nWhere thou shalt behold their beauty and elegance in all their finery\nAnd in the evening thou shalt enjoy a traditional kaiseki meal's delight\nWhere thou shalt sample the finest flavors of Japan's culinary art\n\nSeventh day shall bring thee to the city of Osaka's vibrant streets\nWhere thou shalt sample the city's famous street food's savory delights\nAnd visit the famous Osaka Castle's imposing walls and towers\nWhere thou shalt behold the city's rich history and storied past\n